@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR002: View Client Intervention Alerts" as FAFR002
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions" as CFR003
  usecase "CFR004: Receive Personalized Recommendations" as CFR004
  usecase "CFR005: Manage Recommendation Preferences" as CFR005
  usecase "SAFR002: Deliver Alerts to Users" as SAFR002
  usecase "FAFR003: View Predictive Analytics" as FAFR003
  usecase "CFR006: Manage Spending Limit Alerts" as CFR006
  usecase "SAFR018: Generate Financial Health Reports" as SAFR018
  usecase "FAFR004: Configure Analysis Parameters for Client Segments" as FAFR004
  usecase "CFR007: View Investment Opportunities Based on Risk Profile" as CFR007
  usecase "SFR009: Request Specific Investment Opportunities from AI Component" as SFR009
  usecase "SAFR013: Generate Client Alerts Based on Predefined Conditions" as SAFR013
  usecase "CFR008: View News Related to Portfolio" as CFR008
  usecase "SFR012: Generate Client Dashboards" as SFR012
  usecase "AIFR009: Generate Client Predictive Intervention Recommendations" as AIFR009
  usecase "CFR011: Send Feedback to System" as CFR011

  SysAdmin --> SAFR001 : Manage analysis parameters for AI system.
  
  Client --> [CFR001, CFR002, CFR003, CFR004, CFR005, CFR006, CFR007, CFR008] 
             "View financial insights, alerts, predictions, recommendations."
  FAFR001: View client mentoring sessions based on system-generated insights.
  
  FinancialAdvisor --> [FAFR002, FAFR003, FAFR004]
                     : Manage client intervention/alerts and configure parameters.

  System --> [SAFR001, SAFR002, SAFR003, SAFR004, SAFR005, SAFR006, SAFR007,
              SFR009, SFR018, AIFR001, AIFR002, AIFR003, AIFR004, AIFR005, 
              AIFR006, AIFR007, AIFR008] : Deliver system functionalities.
  
  Client --> SFR012: Generate dashboards.

  SysAdmin --> SAFR013: Manage alerts based on conditions.

  Client --> CFR011: Send feedback to improve the system's outputs.

}

@enduml